Font family :
Outfit, sans-serif                        — all UI text
'JetBrains Mono', monospace               — IDs, registrations, phone, amounts, times


Colors
Text

#10243f   primary ink (titles, values, names)
#44536b   body text in bubbles
#5c6b82   secondary text, meta lines
#7d8ca3   tertiary / roles, idle sidebar icon
#8593a8   muted meta, dates, counts, placeholders
#9aa7ba   faintest meta
#6b7a91   uppercase micro-labels
#b6c0cf   disabled day numbers
#1f4fa8   dark blue accent text, chips, avatar initials
#1f6feb   primary blue (links, active icon, "View →")
#ffffff   on-blue text
#1f7a4d   success text ("added by you")

Surfaces

#ffffff   page + card background
#fbfcfe   subtle panel (message thread area)
#f8fafc   inset chip background
#f4f7fc   soft grey fill (icon tiles, buttons)
#f6f8fb   Sunday cell
#eef4ff   blue tint (avatars, badges, icon tiles)
#dbe7ff   selected calendar day
#f3f8ff   selected radio row
#f6faff   row hover tint
#0f2342   dark bar fill (occupancy meter)
#e8f6ee   success pill background
rgba(12,24,44,0.5)   modal scrim
Borders

#e4e9f2   card border (default)
#eef1f6   inner divider / row top border
#e9edf4   bubble border
#dfe5ef   input border
#f0f3f8   Sunday cell border
#c4cedd   idle radio ring
#1f6feb   focus / hover / selected border
Type scale
34px/700  bus registration (mono)
30px/700  metric value (mono)
27px/700  calendar month
26px/700  modal title
24px/700  split value
23px/700  from/to labels
22px/700  thread header name
21px/600  panel title
19px/700  route student count · stop tile day
19px/600  route name
18px/600  driver name
17px/600  stop group name
17px/400  message bubble text
16px/600  list item titles, spec values, inputs
15px/600  buttons
15px/400  input text, secondary body
14px/600  chips, "View →"
13px/400  meta lines
12px/600  pills, category chips
11px/600  uppercase labels, letter-spacing 0.11em
10px/600  date tile weekday, letter-spacing 0.1em
Headings use letter-spacing: -0.015em to -0.02em; uppercase labels 0.11em.

Geometry
Card:      border-radius 16px; padding 22px; gap 16px; 1px solid #e4e9f2
Stat card: border-radius 14px; padding 20px; gap 12px
Modal:     border-radius 18px; padding 30px; max-width 640px
Inputs:    border-radius 12px; padding 15px
Buttons:   border-radius 12px; padding 14px 26px; min-height 48px
Pills:     border-radius 999px; padding 8px 14px
Avatars:   999px circle — 34 / 38 / 44 / 48px
Grid gap:  18px between cards; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(340px, 1fr))
Sidebar:   padding 18px 14px; item gap 18px; icon 20px
Interaction
Card hover:   transform: translateY(-4px);
              border-color: #1f6feb;
              box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(31,111,235,0.13);
              transition: transform 140ms ease, box-shadow 140ms ease, border-color 140ms ease

Row hover:    background: #f6faff;
              box-shadow: 0 0 0 1.5px #1f6feb;
              transition: box-shadow 130ms ease, background 130ms ease
              (no lift — outline + tint only)

Button hover: primary #1f6feb → #1a5cc8 · ghost #ffffff → #f4f7fc
Disabled CTA: background #9dc0f5, white text, no pointer
Dropdown:     box-shadow 0 22px 48px rgba(12,24,44,0.16); radius 14px; item hover #f4f8ff
Modal:        box-shadow 0 24px 70px rgba(12,24,44,0.28)
Icons
20×20 inline SVG, viewBox="0 0 24 24", fill: none, stroke-linecap/linejoin: round. Active: stroke #1f6feb, width 1.7. Idle: stroke #7d8ca3, width 1.6.

Rules
All styling is inline (no CSS classes). Only @font-face/font links and body resets live in the style block. One blue accent, one grey scale, no gradients, no emoji, no shadows on resting cards.

